==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|nacarat|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|es|en}} or {{etyl|pt|en}} {{term|nacarado|lang=es}}, from {{etyl|ar|en}} {{term|نقارة|lang=ar|tr=naqqāra||small drum}}, from {{term|نقر|lang=ar|tr=náqara||to hollow out}}. Related to the word ''[[nacre]]''.

